=== chromium: help ===
HELP
/compact [instructions] — Compact the context
/new — Start a new session
/name <name> — Name the session
/model [name] — Pick a model
/thinking [level] — Set or cycle the thinking level
/session — Show session info
/export [path] — Export the session as markdown (on the backend)
/copy — Copy the last assistant message
/fork — Fork the session from an earlier message
/clone — Clone the session
/cd [dir] — Change the working directory
/login [provider] [oauth|api_key] — Log in to a provider
/logout <provider> — Log out of a provider
/auth — Show provider credentials
/sessions — Pick a saved session to switch to
/switch <id|path> — Switch to a session by id or path
/host — Pick where tools run
/change_default — Save the current model and thinking level as the default
/help — List the commands
